From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:26:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1567/3799] soh: rename func_80A2FC70 -> EnGb_SwingStick

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs the stick swing: on frame 18 it stirs all four caged souls, plays the wood-hit sfx and rearms the idle timer, and at the end returns to the looping idle animation.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
index be3421ec9..4b1fc1b42 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
@@ -18,7 +18,8 @@ void EnGb_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2F83C: the resting action: counts down to the next stick swing, offers the Poe exchange within 100 units, and routes an accepted trade to the ordinary, small-Poe or big-Poe reply.
 void EnGb_Idle(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2F83C [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80A2FC70(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2FC70: runs the stick swing: on frame 18 it stirs all four caged souls, plays the wood-hit sfx and rearms the idle timer, and at the end returns to the looping idle animation.
+void EnGb_SwingStick(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2FC70 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2FA50: the big-Poe purchase: empties the bottle, pays 50 rupees, adds 100 Poe points and, at exactly 1000, moves on to the bottle reward instead of returning to the idle.
 void EnGb_BuyBigPoe(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2FA50 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2F9C0: the small-Poe purchase reply; it records the conversation and returns to the idle.
@@ -280,7 +281,7 @@ void EnGb_SetupSwingStick(EnGb* this) {
     Animation_Change(&this->skelAnime, &gPoeSellerSwingStickAnim, 1.0f, 0.0f,
                      Animation_GetLastFrame(&gPoeSellerSwingStickAnim), ANIMMODE_ONCE, 0.0f);
     Audio_PlayActorSound2(&this->dyna.actor, NA_SE_EV_NALE_MAGIC);
-    this->actionFunc = func_80A2FC70;
+    this->actionFunc = EnGb_SwingStick;  // was func_80A2FC70 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnGb_Idle(EnGb* this, PlayState* play) {
@@ -391,7 +392,7 @@ void EnGb_FinishGiveBottle(EnGb* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80A2FC70(EnGb* this, PlayState* play) {
+void EnGb_SwingStick(EnGb* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->skelAnime.curFrame == Animation_GetLastFrame(&gPoeSellerSwingStickAnim)) {
         Animation_Change(&this->skelAnime, &gPoeSellerIdleAnim, 1.0f, 0.0f, Animation_GetLastFrame(&gPoeSellerIdleAnim),
                          ANIMMODE_LOOP, 0.0f);
